分片节点配置要同时包含分片表和旧表（否则找不到分片表会报错）：
```yaml
rules:
  - !SHARDING
    tables:
      t_coupon_template:
        actualDataNodes: ds_${0..1}.t_coupon_template_${0..15}
        databaseStrategy:
          standard:
            shardingColumn: shop_number
            shardingAlgorithmName: coupon_template_database_mod
    shardingAlgorithms:
      coupon_template_database_mod:
        type: CLASS_BASED
        props:
          algorithmClassName: com.nageoffer.onecoupon.merchant.admin.dao.sharding.DBHashModShardingAlgorithm
          sharding-count: 16
          strategy: standard
```
自定义算法的开关 + 双写标识（文档示例形态）：
```java
@Override
public String doSharding(Collection<String> availableTargetNames, PreciseShardingValue<Date> shardingValue) {
    if (!getOpenShard() || shardSyncData()) {
        return "pay_info";
    }
    return "pay_info_shard_2022";
}

private boolean shardSyncData() {
    return MDC.get("shard_sync") == null ? false : true;
}
```
Canal 消费端置标识，操作完必须清掉：
```java
try {
    MDC.put("shard_sync", "true");
    // 操作数据库...
} finally {
    MDC.remove("shard_sync");
}
```

